                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a good tower defence game that I used to play on mobile, and now revisiting on the PC. Addictive and nice and long if you want to beat each difficulty. Its not without its problems though, and overall, I can't really recommend it. \nSome of the levels are almost Impossible on Hard, At lest three of the weapons are basically useless (Machine Gun, Laser and Flamethrower) and are never viable in any situation, so you end up using the same strategy over and over again.\n\nBoth of these things could have been just a case of tweeking the numbers, but for some reason it never happened. I imagine a lot of hours went into its development, but for whatever reason (perhaps the sequel had something to do with it), it was just left to rot as an imbalanced game. Shame, as otherwise is pretty good.",
